Template: tt-local-generator/hf-token
Type: password
Default:
Description: HuggingFace access token (optional for SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B)
 The SkyReels-V2-I2V-14B-540P model (~58 GB) is publicly available on
 HuggingFace without a license gate.
 .
 Note: this model uses the Wan2.2-T2V-A14B-Diffusers checkpoint for its
 VAE and T5 text encoder. The tt-model-wan2-t2v package must also be
 installed (it is a declared dependency and will be installed automatically).
 .
 A HuggingFace token can be provided to avoid API rate limits during
 download. Leave blank to download anonymously.
 .
 Your token is used once and immediately discarded — it is not stored by
 this package. To skip providing a token, just press Enter.
